tory finishes</li></ul></span>\n<span class=\"bullet\">When you have typed in ALL your answers, click the <span class=\"strong\">Go to Writing Task</span> button. </span></span>\n</br>\n</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">My Narrative</span>", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Activity 3", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"correct_feedback": "You are done!", "allowed_attempts": 2, "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}, {"type": "learning_skills", "contents": [{"content": "Reading", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Writing", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Listening", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Speaking", "type": "skill"}]}, {"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": "<span class=\"strong\">It's time to review your narrative.</span> <br/>When you are writing your narrative, remember to include:<ul><li>A title</li><li>\nCharacters, setting, plot and conclusion</li><li>\nThe Simple Past tense and the Present Perfect tense</li></ul>\n\nProofread your narrative for any spelling, grammar or punctuation errors.\n</br>\nRead your narrative aloud to a partner.</br>\nClick the <span class=\"strong\">Submit</span> button to save your work.", "type": "text"}]}, {"grading_contents": {"header": {"rows": [{"cells": [{"content": "", "colspan": 1, "content_type": "text", "element": "th"}, {"content": "", "colspan": 5, "content_type": "text", "element": "th"}]}, {"cells": [{"content": "", "colspan": 1, "content_type": "text", "element": "th"}, {"content": "", "colspan": 1, "content_type": "text", "element": "th"}, {"content": "", "colspan": 1, "content_type": "text", "element": "th"}, {"content": "", "colspan": 1, "content_type": "text", "element": "th"}, {"content": "", "colspan": 1, "content_type": "text", "element": "th"}]}]}, "body": {"rows": [{"cells": [{"content": "", "colspan": 1, "c