e": "skill"}]}, {"type": "post_instructions", "contents": [{"content": "Instructions: Complete the following steps. Fill in the Self-Assessment.", "type": "text"}]}], "type": "DWS", "template_override": 1}], "stimuli": [{"_data": [], "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "template_override": 1, "id": 0}, {"id": 1, "title": "", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": "engenn8le16ob08re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "I have never shared this story with anyone. It has shaken me and left me with nightmares. As I walked home along the bank of Irondale lake, something strange happened. It was after 8 p.m. and I'd had an aggravating day of tests at university. Everything was quiet and there was a full moon high in the evening sky. A party had been organized by my friends at a local pub but I had arrived too late. So, I decided to return home. Along the way, I sat on a park bench near the lake shore and contemplated the beauty of nature.  Feeling relaxed, a little tired, I closed my eyes and before too long, I was fast asleep.<br/>", "id": 1, "time": "100", "image": "engenn8le16ob08re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "When I opened my eyes again, I noticed the weather. Clouds had covered the moon and the night had become cold and dark. I rubbed my eyes to wake up but felt disoriented.  Suddenly, I heard a sound coming from the water.  What I saw in the murky water was absolutely horrifying.  Slowly, a dark figure began to emerge from the water. I was paralyzed by the shocking sight. The menacing, faceless animal moved closer and started to extend his arms to latch onto my legs.", "id": 2, "time": "52000", "image": "engenn8le16ob08re2img02.jpg"}, {"text": "Then, from out of nowhere, someone appeared on the shore next to me. His clothing was bizarre and he had a deranged look about his face as he shouted, \u201cGet back, beast from the darkness!\u201d  With a flash of light, the monster snarled and then vanished slipping under the rippling waters of Irondale lake. The stranger turned to me and barked, \u201cIf there is a full moon, never ever fall asleep by the lake.\u201d He then stepped forward and whispered, \u201cThe Moon Silths will get you.\u201d Suddenly, he too vanished in a flash of light leaving me standing at the foot of the lake shore. Shocked and confused I wondered, \u201cWhat in heaven is a Moon Silth and who was this mysterious stranger who saved me? I stumbled to my feet, glanced at the moon and scurried home ... I have been terrified of the lake ever since.<br/>", "id": 3, "time": "90000", "image": "engenn8le16ob08re2img03.jpg"}], "audiosrc": "engenn8le16ob08re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn8le16ob08re2img01.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "_data": [], "type": "audio", "template_override": 1}, {"id": 2, "title": "", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": ""}, {"text": "Writing A Narrative", "id": 1, "time": "5000", "image": ""}, {"text": "<span class = \"bullet\">The passive voice</span>", "id": 2, "time": "6000", "image": ""}, {"text": "<span class = \"bullet\">The simple past and present perfect tenses</span>", "id": 3, "time": "98000", "image": ""}], "video_src": "engenn8le16ob08re3vid01"}, "type": "video"}], "_data": [], "type": "video", "template_override": 1}]}]}